  "story": {
    "title": "My Family",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "I'm Tuktuk.I have a large family. Let's meet them!",
      "This is my mom, and this is my dad.",
      "This is my brother, Neetu and this is my sister, Meetu.",
      "These are my paternal grandparents, and these are my maternal grandparents.",
      "My mom has three sisters. I call them 'Mausi'. And next...",
      "My dad has four brothers. I call two of them 'Thaauji' and two of them 'Chachaji'. Along with them...",
      "I also have two 'Thaayi' and two 'Chachi' as well. Let's see...",
      "There are five, young children in my family too.",
      "We all together cause mischief in the house.",
      "Look at how big my family is!",
      "Oh, wait! I almost forgot about Bujo. It wags its tail and barks, \"Bow, bow, bow!!\""
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "I'm Tuktuk.I have a large family.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mình là Tuktuk. Mình có một gia đình rất đông."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Let's meet them!",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cùng gặp họ nhé!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "This is my mom, and this is my dad.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đây là mẹ mình, và đây là bố mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "This is my brother, Neetu and this is my sister, Meetu.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đây là anh trai mình, Neetu, và đây là em gái mình, Meetu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "These are my paternal grandparents, and these are my maternal grandparents.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đây là ông bà nội của mình, và đây là ông bà ngoại của mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "My mom has three sisters.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ mình có ba chị em gái."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I call them 'Mausi'. And next...",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mình gọi họ là 'Mausi'. Và tiếp theo..."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "My dad has four brothers.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bố mình có bốn anh em trai."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I call two of them 'Thaauji' and two of them 'Chachaji'.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mình gọi hai người là 'Thaauji' và hai người là 'Chachaji'."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Along with them...",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cùng với họ nữa..."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I also have two 'Thaayi' and two 'Chachi' as well. Let's see...",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mình cũng có hai 'Thaayi' và hai 'Chachi' nữa. Để xem nào..."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "There are five, young children in my family too.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trong gia đình mình cũng có năm bạn nhỏ nữa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "We all together cause mischief in the house.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tất cả chúng mình cùng nhau nghịch ngợm trong nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Look at how big my family is!",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhìn xem gia đình mình đông đúc biết bao!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Oh, wait! I almost forgot about Bujo.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ôi, đợi chút! Mình suýt quên mất Bujo rồi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It wags its tail and barks, \"Bow, bow, bow!!\"",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_100912/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó vẫy đuôi và sủa, \"Gâu, gâu, gâu!!\""
      }
    ]
  },
